    <!-- Centre of the power key (fingerprint sensor) in the built-in display's
         natural orientation (portrait 1600x2560, origin top left). In landscape
         (ROTATION_90) the key is on the left edge, about 18 mm below the top of
         the visible area: the natural top edge, 172 px from its right end.
         Derived from Huawei's outline drawing and the device dimensions, to
         about 2 mm. The HAL reports the same point to the side fingerprint
         indicator, as the key start 1350 and radius 78. -->
    <dimen name="physical_fingerprint_sensor_center_screen_location_x">1428px</dimen>
    <dimen name="physical_fingerprint_sensor_center_screen_location_y">0px</dimen>
